    <string name="t_the_recording_button_on_the_call">The recording button on the call screen records with the microphone. Android doesn\'t allow recording the call audio itself, so only your voice and, when the speaker is on, the other person\'s voice are captured. Files are saved in My Files > Music > SuperDialer. Check the laws on recording calls before using it.</string>
